--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The QM-LUX *source distribution* (this repository, the `qm_lux` wheel and sdist)
contains only Apache-2.0 licensed material authored for this project.

The QM-LUX *container image* (`ghcr.io/bedapub/qm-lux`) additionally
REDISTRIBUTES third-party software under other licences, some of them copyleft.
A complete, generated inventory of every redistributed component, its version
and its declared licence is in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md. The components that
carry obligations beyond attribution are summarised below.

Gaussian 16 is NOT redistributed. It is commercial software, is deliberately not
included in the image, and is executed against the user's own licensed
installation on the host.

All third-party components are unmodified binaries as published by their
respective packagers (conda-forge, PyPI). QM-LUX applies no patches to them.


