--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    ase  3.23.0  Copyright (C) ASE developers
                 https://gitlab.com/ase/ase

The Atomic Simulation Environment. Unlike xtb and crest, ASE IS imported
directly by QM-LUX Python code (`src/qm_lux/cli.py`, `src/qm_lux/utils/gaussian.py`)
